      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm not really looking for analogies like tightrope walkers. Can we keep this strictly to the engineering specifics? I need to understand the exact relationship between the asphalt's temperature-viscosity profile and the resulting tensile stresses during the thermal cycles. How does the bitumen's rheology specifically fail under the Phoenix temperature range?",
